    {
      "displayText": "請收下報酬。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 5172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB65364E0B5831916C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，\n衷心期待您的再次光臨唷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 5188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C000A88775FC3671F5F8560A87684518D6B21514981E8553730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒有可以戰鬥的寶可夢了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 5224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92670953EF4EE562309B2576845BF653EF59224E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n無法動彈了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000000A71216CD552D55F484E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "無法讓您享用寶可夢對戰到最後，\n我們感到很遺憾哪。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這位客人～歡迎您再來挑戰！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71216CD58B9360A84EAB75285BF653EF59225C0D6230523067005F8CFF0C000A62115011611F52305F88907A61BE54EA300200100001BE00000A90194F4D5BA24EBAFF5E6B618FCE60A8518D4F8663116230FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您肚子已經飽了吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這是感謝您盡情享受\n本店的謝禮唷。收下吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8809A5B505DF27D9398FD4E865427300200100001BE01000A9019662F611F8B1D60A876E160C54EAB53D7000A672C5E9776848B1D79AE5537300265364E0B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位客人～！\n雖然下次開始會收您<U+E300>30000，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但還是歡迎您再次光臨唷！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
